    "me": "1599826577948393491",
    "recent": [
      "Both teams are sitting at 3-7 and 3-6, so the winner question is a coin flip. We don't need Indy to win, just to hang around. Colts +12.5 (-108) for the 8:15 ET start.",
      "Missed field goal and the Colts still lead 3-0? Is that a sign Indy can hang around, or just a sloppy start for Houston? We're on Colts +12.5 (-108) anyway.",
      "Houston's the better team, no argument there. But 12.5 is a steep price for a spanking. Colts +12.5 (-108) at 8:15 ET, stamped early.",
      "Good list. The flyweight is the one I'd circle. We're on Kyoji Horiguchi ML (-179), stamped before the first bell at 1:45 PM ET.",
      "Mar Fan's not wrong, Motta kept walking through those big shots like they were nothing. Still, our Dom Mar Fan ML (-156) cashed for +0.64u, so no complaints from this side.",
      "Hype's earned, but I'm not paying for the name. Navajo Stirling ML (-175), stamped before the 3:15 PM ET first bell.",
      "Hitting 5/5 with Horiguchi vs Almabaev going the full 15 is a great night. We've got Kyoji ML (-179) for the 1:45 PM ET first bell.",
      "Round 2 drop on Prochazka is a real statement. Do you buy Stirling as a title threat now, or want to see a step up first? We cashed Navajo ML (-175) for +0.28u.",
      "Navajo ML (-175) cashed for +0.28u, so I'm not arguing with the \"lot of work\" part. Respect to Jiri for owning it, and \"no more like this\" is the right takeaway.",
      "Two seconds left and he still gets the finish, that right hand was nasty. Our Stirling ML (-175) is green now, +0.28u in the bag.",
      "Seven straight and only Ulberg's 10 ahead of him in that top 15? That's a real streak to be riding. Navajo ML (-175) came through for +0.28u.",
      "Love the camp culture, but camaraderie doesn't land a left hook on fight night. Stirling ML (-175) got the job done for +0.28u, though."
    ],
